{"id":"H1609","lemma":"גַּעְתָּם","transliteration":"gatam","sayIt":"ga-TAM","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Gatam","meaning":"A man of the Edomites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.11;\nson of: Eliphaz (H0464);\nbrother of: Teman (H8487), Omar (H0201), Zepho (H6825), Kenaz (H7073), Amalek (H6002H) and Korah (H7141H)\n§ Gatam = \"a burnt valley\"\nfourth son of Eliphaz and grandson of Esau and one of the dukes of Eliphaz","glosses":["gatam"],"count":3,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"Gatam","kjv":"and Gatam"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"Gatam","kjv":"Gatam"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"Gatam","kjv":"and Gatam"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 36:11","note":"The sons of Eliphaz were Teman, Omar, Zepho, and Gatam, and Kenaz.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:36","note":"The sons of Eliphaz: Teman, Omar, Zephi, Gatam, Kenaz, Timna, and Amalek.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0201","lemma":"אוֹמָר","transliteration":"omar","gloss":"Omar"},{"id":"H0464","lemma":"אֱלִיפַז","transliteration":"eliphaz","gloss":"Eliphaz"},{"id":"H8487","lemma":"תֵּימָן","transliteration":"teman","gloss":"Teman"},{"id":"H6825","lemma":"צְפוֹ, צְפִי","transliteration":"tsepho","gloss":"Zepho"},{"id":"H7073","lemma":"קְנַז","transliteration":"qenaz","gloss":"Kenaz"},{"id":"H6002","lemma":"עֲמָלֵק","transliteration":"amaleq","gloss":"Amalek"},{"id":"H7141","lemma":"קֹ֫רַח","transliteration":"qorach","gloss":"Korah"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}